 {"name":"InterContinental Hotel Osaka","aliases":"InterContinental Hotel Osaka|InterContinental Osaka","city":"osaka","description":"A high-rise Grand Front Osaka retreat with expansive rooms, Japanese bath, pool and adee bar, only a short walk from Doyama's neon lanes.","vibe":"serene vertical luxury poised above Osaka's gay district","tags":"luxury,relax,social","hours":"Reception operates 24 hours; bath, pool, spa, restaurants and bars vary.","link":"https://www.ihg.com/intercontinental/hotels/gb/en/osaka/osaha/hoteldetail","location":"3-60 Ofuka-cho, Kita Ward, Osaka 530-0011, Japan","lat":34.70515,"lng":135.49463,"arrival":"Grand Front's towers complicate first arrival; confirm bath etiquette and adapted facilities.","best":"Best for couples wanting Doyama access with serious spa and luxury recovery.","crowd":"LGBTQ+ Pride guests mix with international luxury, business and dining visitors.","dress":"Refined city casual.","inclusion":"Official participant in Visit Gay Osaka's 2026 Pride campaign with dedicated rainbow cocktail programming.","basis":"Current tourism-bureau Pride partnership plus active first-party hotel source.","class":"Five-star InterContinental luxury hotel","coords":"Exact official address checked 2026-08-28.","sources":["https://visitgayosaka.com/column/columns/pride-2026.html","https://www.ihg.com/intercontinental/hotels/gb/en/osaka/osaha/hoteldetail"]},
